      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "MICK SWAGGER (1) finished fourth last time at this track but could not have been more impressive before that in his powerful 17.55 win at this track over 305m. Hot win two back and looks the one to beat here. GUS LIMES (3) had been in super honest form hitting the frame two times on end before finishing fifth (18.08) at this track last time. Form at the trip sound including seven wins. Good beginner aided by a nice draw. One of the main contenders. OLLIE LIMES (7) turned in a better run last time to find a minor placing (17.86) at this track behind Cinematic in a Grade 2/3/4. Has the early speed to land on the pace and can stick on. Expected to feature. MAJOR QUEEN (5) is always hard to beat when she races here at this trip.",
